{"name": "Backpack Raiders", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"323\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/extras/88b6ff45f4ea3728beda77c3d5fb39d5.avif?t=1781315027\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build Your Loadout. Outplay the Swarm. Thrive in the City.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decades after a catastrophic event wiped humanity off the map, <strong>mutated bugs rose from the ruins and turned entire cities into their hives.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a <strong>mercenary-for-hire</strong>, one of the rare survivors trained to breach the infested city walls and bring back what everyone else fears to touch: <strong>bug parts</strong>. Valuable, volatile, and vital for making a profit in the new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"708\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/extras/b17251b428421b0d9254979f9648814a.avif?t=1781315027\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"323\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/extras/01079acea2895f31f089e9bcff1a0a7a.avif?t=1781315027\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Fast, Hectic, Wave Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash, shoot, blast, or slice your way through escalating swarms in quick waves.  <br/>Find weapons, merge upgrades, and create powerful builds as you fight to survive long enough for extraction.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Auto-firing and manual-aim hybrid combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runs designed to be quick, chaotic, and endlessly replayable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of items and endless synergies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"330\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/extras/618e85088e3510fe8af4971d23d2a671.poster.avif?t=1781315027\" width=\"586\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/extras/618e85088e3510fe8af4971d23d2a671.webm?t=1781315027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/extras/618e85088e3510fe8af4971d23d2a671.mp4?t=1781315027\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"323\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/extras/3403ff36d1a88411b7e89f3e4fd2012b.avif?t=1781315027\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf92 A Smarter Backpack Means a Stronger You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your backpack is your build.<br/>Every weapon, trinket, attachment, and oddity fits into a <strong>grid-based inventory</strong> where <strong>position, adjacency, and orientation matter.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover items with unique shapes and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build insane synergies based on placement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge items into new and powerful tools</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pack smarter. Live longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/extras/0f2086f84d4d4af8f741df476b6bb6c4.poster.avif?t=1781315027\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/extras/0f2086f84d4d4af8f741df476b6bb6c4.webm?t=1781315027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/extras/0f2086f84d4d4af8f741df476b6bb6c4.mp4?t=1781315027\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"323\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/extras/835c7b4979e5e3d8d32a52d8e6197225.avif?t=1781315027\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Construct a Strategic Outpost for Permanent Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raid the city, earn supplies, and use them between runs to construct buildings that grant permanent, run-boosting upgrades. Place workshops, armories, trading posts, and other specialty structures, each offering powerful bonuses, new unlocks, and stronger starting loadouts.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your outpost and place buildings strategically to create powerful synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new mercenaries and loadouts by constructing specialized housing and facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock buildings that allow you to set the difficulty and earn better rewards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/extras/6ecbd795ac5408a40f86eeca177e5382.poster.avif?t=1781315027\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/extras/6ecbd795ac5408a40f86eeca177e5382.webm?t=1781315027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/extras/6ecbd795ac5408a40f86eeca177e5382.mp4?t=1781315027\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Backpack Raiders is a hybrid survival roguelite + tactical inventory builder where how you arrange your gear is just as important as the gear you choose. Build Your Loadout. Outplay the Swarm. Thrive in the City.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880100/ae45ce6d29c05898475fd733113081b02905c8c1/header.jpg?t=1781315027", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike", "Indie", "Singleplayer", "Bullet Hell", "Action", "Inventory Management"], "developers": "WollemGames", "publishers": "WollemGames", "release_date": "Jun 3, 2026", "price": "$4.95", "appid": "1880100", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "27 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/IBxH_h8Fjlc", "first_seen": 1769468400.0, "review_rank": 1328}